# Match Polls (MVP)

Every confirmed match has exactly two polls:

1. **Availability** — available / not available (open pool; no hard yes-cap)
2. **Carpool** — carpool vs coming on own

## Playing squad (separate from the pool)

- Final **playing squad** is 11–12 members in `match_squad_members`
- Fees charge **squad members only**, not everyone who voted available
- At availability freeze (Cron match day − 1 **18:00 IST** or Admin early freeze):
  - If yes-count is **11 or 12** → auto-finalize squad = all yes voters + in-app + WhatsApp
  - If yes-count **> 12** → freeze pool only; Admin picks 11–12 (`finalizePlayingSquad`) then notify
  - If yes-count **< 11** → do **not** freeze; keep voting open, mark
    `squad_finalization_pending_at`, and alert Admin to recruit players
  - After a short-pool freeze attempt, players may continue joining without a
    cap; Admin must explicitly confirm 11–12, then freeze + notify
- Before freeze, every additional yes vote over 12 sends an Admin-only alert
- At freeze, an oversubscribed pool freezes silently and waits for Admin; Cron
  does not send a squad notification until Admin confirms 11–12
- Unfreeze clears `squad_finalized_at` and squad rows

## Rules

- One vote per member per poll; latest wins until that poll freezes
- **Availability**: players change freely until **match day − 1** (auto) or Admin early freeze
- Admin may **unfreeze availability** before kickoff (reopens player voting + notifies squad)
- **Carpool**: stays open until **match kickoff** (IST); not closed by availability freeze
- After a poll freezes: Admin-only edits (`MATCH_POLL_OVERRIDE`)
- Only Admin may manually freeze / unfreeze availability; there is no Player freeze action
- Everyone can see who is available; after finalize, UI shows the playing squad

## Carpool fee (post-match assignment)

- Pre-match carpool poll is **intent only** — fees ignore poll votes
- After kickoff, Admin assigns real drivers + passengers (`match_carpool_rides`)
- **Any active player** may drive or ride — not limited to the playing squad or Admins
- Passenger pays **₹100**; driver earns **₹100 credit per passenger**
- Empty assignment (nobody carpooled) is valid once Admin saves it
- Match day **14:00 IST** Cron reminds Admins (in-app + individual WhatsApp)

## Repository / service

- Repository: CRUD only (squad + carpool rides/passengers)
- Service: freeze → auto/Admin finalize, assign carpool, complete/cancel match
- `matches.polls_frozen` means **availability** is frozen (carpool uses poll `status`)
- `matches.squad_finalized_at` means the billable XI/XII is locked
- `matches.carpool_assigned_at` means Admin saved post-match rides
- Only Admin marks **completed** (after assignment) or **cancelled** (no fees)
